      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The checker fails when\n- an Accepted/Implemented criterion has no tagged test\n- a tag names a criterion no spec defines (typo, deleted AC)\n- the PR body has no Spec: line\nDraft specs only warn. IDs are never reused or reordered.",
